titleStmt.title:
Convention between the Republic of Haiti and the Banque Nationale de la
                    République d’Haiti, in Settlement of the Amounts Remaining Due to the Bank;
                    Signed at Port au Prince April 12, 1919

div.p:
Between the undersigned: 1.
M. Fleury Féquière, Secretary of State for Finance and Commerce, duly authorized by the Council of the Secretaries of State and assisted by Mr. John McIlhenny, Financial Adviser, acting for the Haitian Government on the one part; 2.
M. O. Scarpa, Manager of the Banque Nationale de la République d’Haiti, acting for the said Bank on the other part;
